@startuml
title Online Top-up via Payment Gateway (Swimlane Activity Diagram)

|Student|
start
:Open web/app and log in;
:Select "Top-up wallet";
:Enter top-up amount;
:Choose payment method (e.g. VNPAY, MoMo);

|Wallet System|
:Create PENDING top-up order
(orderId, studentId, amount);
:Store order in DB with status = "PENDING";
:Generate payment request (orderId, amount, returnUrl, callbackUrl, signature);
:Redirect / send student to Payment Gateway page;

|Payment Gateway|
:Display payment page (amount, merchant info);
:Student enters bank / e-wallet details;
:Process payment with bank/third-party;

if (Payment approved by bank?) then (yes)
  :Mark transaction SUCCESS on gateway side;
else (no)
  :Mark transaction FAILED on gateway side;
endif

:Redirect student back to Wallet System return URL
(with basic result info);

|Wallet System|
:Receive browser return from gateway;
:Show provisional result screen to student
("Processing" / "Success" / "Failed");
note right
Browser return is only for user experience.
Final decision depends on server-to-server
callback (IPN) from the payment gateway.
end note

:Wait for server-to-server callback (IPN);

|Payment Gateway|
:Send IPN/Callback to Wallet System
(orderId, status, amount, signature);

|Wallet System|
:Receive IPN/Callback;
:Verify signature & data consistency;

if (Signature valid AND status = SUCCESS?) then (yes)
  :Check if order is still PENDING;
  if (Order already processed?) then (yes)
    :Ignore (idempotent handling);
  else (no)
    :Update order status = "SUCCESS";
    :Increase student's wallet balance by amount;
    :Create wallet transaction record (TOPUP_ONLINE);
  endif
else (no)
  :Update order status = "FAILED" or "CANCELLED";
  :Do NOT change wallet balance;
endif

|Student|
:Later, open wallet screen again;
:View updated balance and top-up transaction;
stop

|Finance / Accounting|
:Periodically run reconciliation reports
between Wallet System and Payment Gateway;
@enduml
